# Silverbough (biome: elf_city) - 31x23 elven town in the Misty Highlands
# The elves live in the highland pinewood (elf_archer / elf_swordsman are both
# biomes: ["highlands"]), so their town stands there, not in the forest that
# only carries their name. Reached through the arch at (2,10) on highlands.map;
# no monsters inside the wall.
